plates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 15; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: pricing, section, billing, cta, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nSynthetix Intelligence Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nSynthetix Solutions Showcase Company Pricing GET IN TOUCH Active Neural Network Convert Noise Into Clarity— Intelligence Scaled. Automatically route, process, and extract deep semantic value from unstructured data strea…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Convert Noise Into Clarity— Intelligence Scaled..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F97316, secondary #F5F4EF, accent #F97316, background #F5F4EF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Synthetix - Intelligence Scaled</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#f5f4ef] text-neutral-900 font-['Inter'] antialiased overflow-x-hidden relative selection:bg-orange-200 selection:text-orange-900\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"relative z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 md:px-12 w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-orange-600\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight\">Synthetix</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-neutral-500 font-light\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1\">Solutions <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-xs\"></iconify-icon></a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors\">Showcase</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors\">Company</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 text-sm\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-lg text-neutral-500\">\n                <button class=\"hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:text-square-linear\"></iconify-icon></button>\n                <button class=\"hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\"></iconify-icon></button>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:block bg-neutral-900 text-white px-5 py-2 hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors tracking-wide rounded-full text-xs font-medium\">GET IN TOUCH</a>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Section - Split Layout -->\n    <main id=\"hero-section\" class=\"relative z-10 w-full min-h-[85vh] grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 items-center pt-12 md:pt-0 px-6 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto pb-20 gap-12 lg:gap-0\">\n\n        <!-- Left Content: Typography & CTA -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start justify-center pt-10 lg:pt-0 pl-0 md:pl-6 max-w-2xl relative z-20\">\n\n            <!-- Live Feed Tag -->\n            <div class=\"floating-el flex items-center gap-2 bg-neutral-900/5 border border-neutral-900/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-neutral-600 text-xs mb-8\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:soundwave-linear\" class=\"text-orange-600\"></iconify-icon> Active Neural Network\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-neutral-900 font-normal mb-8\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2\">\n                    <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-text block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">Convert</span></span>\n                    <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-text block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">Noise</span></span>\n\n                    <!-- Integrated Waveform -->\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex items-end gap-[2px] h-10 md:h-14 mx-1 md:mx-2 opacity-80\">\n                        <span class=\"w-1 md:w-1.5 bg-orange-300 rounded-t-sm animate-pulse\" style=\"height: 30%;\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-1 md:w-1.5 bg-orange-400 rounded-t-sm\" style=\"height: 60%;\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-1 md:w-1.5 bg-orange-500 rounded-t-sm animate-pulse\" style=\"height: 100%; animation-delay: 0.2s;\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-1 md:w-1.5 bg-neutral-800 rounded-t-sm\" style=\"height: 80%;\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-1 md:w-1.5 bg-neutral-900 rounded-t-sm animate-pulse\" style=\"height: 40%; animation-delay: 0.1s;\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-1 md:w-1.5 bg-orange-500 rounded-t-sm\" style=\"height: 50%;\"></span>\n                    </span>\n\n                    <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-text block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">Into</span></span>\n                    <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-text block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">Clarity—</span></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 mt-2\">\n                    <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-text block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">Intelligence</span></span>\n                    <span style=\"overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex;\"><span class=\"reveal-text block text-orange-600\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">Scaled.</span></span>\n                </div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\" class=\"mb-10\">\n                <p class=\"reveal-text text-base md:text-lg text-neutral-500 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-lg\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">\n                    Automatically route, process, and extract deep semantic value from unstructured data streams using next-generation contextual models.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- CTAs -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6 w-full\">\n                <button class=\"bg-neutral-900 text-white text-xs px-7 py-3.5 hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors tracking-wide rounded-full font-medium shadow-lg shadow-neutral-900/20\">START BUILDING</button>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 text-neutral-400\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:camera-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon> <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Vision</span></a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-round-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon> <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Language</span></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Content: Floating Elements positioned over the Globe -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-[50vh] lg:h-full min-h-[400px] z-20 flex pointer-events-none mt-8 lg:mt-0\">\n\n            <!-- Floating Card Top Left -->\n            <div class=\"floating-el absolute top-[5%] lg:top-[15%] left-[5%] lg:-left-[10%] w-56 p-5 bg-[#f5f4ef]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl pointer-events-auto\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(#f5f4ef, #f5f4ef) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(249,115,22,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                <div class=\"text-4xl tracking-tight font-light text-neutral-900 flex items-center mb-1\">\n                    10M<span class=\"text-orange-500 font-normal\">+</span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed font-light\">Real-time contextual indexing events processed per second.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Mini Tag -->\n            <div class=\"floating-el absolute top-[40%] right-[10%] items-center gap-2 bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-orange-600 text-xs pointer-events-auto hidden md:flex backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"animate-pulse\"></iconify-icon> Compiling Data\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Card Bottom Right -->\n            <div class=\"floating-el absolute bottom-[10%] lg:bottom-[20%] right-[5%] lg:right-[10%] w-60 p-5 bg-[#f5f4ef]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl pointer-events-auto text-right\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(#f5f4ef, #f5f4ef) padding-box, linear-gradient(225deg, rgba(249,115,22,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                <div class=\"text-4xl tracking-tight font-light text-neutral-900 flex items-center justify-end mb-1\">\n                    99.9<span class=\"text-orange-500 text-2xl ml-1\">%</span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed font-light\">Precision in emotional context detection and language routing.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Badge Center Bottom -->\n            <div class=\"floating-el absolute bottom-[0%] lg:bottom-[5%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 lg:-translate-x-0 lg:left-[20%] flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 pr-5 bg-[#f5f4ef]/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full pointer-events-auto\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(#f5f4ef, #f5f4ef) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.05), rgba(249,115,22,0.3)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-600\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:asterisk-linear\" class=\"text-xs\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-600 font-normal\">\n                    Unlocked Value, Instant Access\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Masked Staggered Text Reveal linked to ScrollTrigger\n        gsap.to(\".reveal-text\", {\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: \"#hero-section\",\n                start: \"top 80%\",\n            },\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 1.2,\n            stagger: 0.08,\n            ease: \"power4.out\",\n            delay: 0.1\n        });\n\n        // Subtle floating animation for premium cards\n        gsap.to(\".floating-el\", {\n            y: -12,\n            duration: 3.5,\n            ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n            stagger: {\n                each: 0.4,\n                from: \"random\"\n            },\n            yoyo: true,\n            repeat: -1\n        });\n\n        // --- Three.js Particle Globe (Stripe Style) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n\n            // Initial camera positioning based on screen size for split layout\n            const updateCameraPosition = () => {\n                if (window.innerWidth >= 1024) {\n                    camera.position.z = 6;\n                    camera.position.x = -2.5; // Shift camera left so globe appears on right\n                    camera.position.y = 0;\n                } else {\n                    camera.position.z = 7;\n                    camera.position.x = 0;\n                    camera.position.y = -1; // Shift down slightly on mobile\n                }\n            };\n            updateCameraPosition();\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Generate Fibonacci Sphere points\n            const numPoints = 1500;\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const positions = new Float32Array(numPoints * 3);\n\n            const phi = Math.PI * (3 - Math.sqrt(5)); // Golden angle\n            const radius = 2.8;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < numPoints; i++) {\n                const y = 1 - (i / (numPoints - 1)) * 2;\n                const r = Math.sqrt(1 - y * y);\n                const theta = phi * i;\n\n                const x = Math.cos(theta) * r;\n                const z = Math.sin(theta) * r;\n\n                positions[i * 3] = x * radius;\n                positions[i * 3 + 1] = y * radius;\n                positions[i * 3 + 2] = z * radius;\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\n\n            // Particle Material\n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                color: 0xf97316, // Orange brand color\n                size: 0.035,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.45,\n                sizeAttenuation: true\n            });\n\n            const globe = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n\n            // Tilt the globe slightly for a better angle\n            globe.rotation.z = 0.2;\n            scene.add(globe);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                // Smooth, slow rotation\n                globe.rotation.y += 0.0015;\n                globe.rotation.x += 0.0005;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                updateCameraPosition();\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initWebGL);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "synthetix-intelligence-scaled.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/synthetix-intelligence-scaled.jpg", "source_name": "synthetix-intelligence-scaled-DESIGN.md", "views": 210, "forks": 12, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:13:40.81452+00:00"}